XTREME INSTALLABLE WEB APP (PWA)

This build can be installed on Android and iPhone/iPad from a web browser and opens like an app.

IMPORTANT:
A PWA must be hosted over HTTPS (or localhost) for service-worker installation.

Android:
1. Put these files on an HTTPS website.
2. Open the site in Chrome.
3. Use the browser menu -> "Install app" / "Add to Home screen".

iPhone/iPad:
1. Open the HTTPS site in Safari.
2. Tap Share -> "Add to Home Screen".

The game data is currently stored locally on the device. Online accounts, cloud leaderboards, payments and store publishing are not included yet.
